  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Garipalli Balakishan vs The State Of Telangana on 31 January, 2024 Crl.Petition No.2247 of 2020 1 The Honourable Sri Justice K.Surender Criminal Petition No.2247 Of 2020 Order: This Criminal Petition under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 is filed by the petitioner-Accused No.2 to quash the proceedings initiated against him in F.I.R.No.50 of 2020, of Siricilla Police Station, Rajanna Siricilla District, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 270 and 273 of I.P.C and Section 59(1) of Food Safety of Standard Act, 2006.",
    "facts": "3. The crime was registered on the ground that Tobacco products were found in possession of the petitioner-Accused No.2 and the same were seized by the police.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
